Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.57,0:02:24.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,接下來為您播報世界頭條消息
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.54,0:02:27.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,非洲在持續干旱的情況下
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.74,0:02:28.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為尋覓水源
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.04,0:02:33.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,發生成群的火鸛鳥\N在一夕之間消失的怪現象
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.62,0:02:37.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為油輪漏出的原油\N而讓苦無居所的海鳥群
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.52,0:02:39.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也在不知不覺中全都消失了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.05,0:02:42.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喔…這真的很詭異耶
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.59,0:02:43.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.79,0:02:45.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.29,0:02:48.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你又要說\N它們是被外星人帶走的對吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.46,0:02:49.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒錯
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.50,0:02:51.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一種像鳥的外星人
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.07,0:02:54.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄的想法太幼稚了啦
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.47,0:02:56.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,外星人是長得像鱆魚耶
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.04,0:02:59.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我覺得\N大雄說得也很有可能
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.11,0:03:03.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(世界候鳥野鳥分布圖)\N從這次的共同研究我查到了…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.11,0:03:07.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,世界上有很多關于鳥人的傳說喔
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.98,0:03:08.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鳥人？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.72,0:03:12.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,外型像鳥的人類\N叫做鳥人沒錯吧…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.32,0:03:14.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒錯\N一定是這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.42,0:03:15.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,比如說…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.49,0:03:17.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這個古亞述時代的精靈圖像…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.96,0:03:22.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然身體是人的樣子\N可是卻有老鷹的頭跟翅膀
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.76,0:03:28.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還有 埃及神荷魯斯\N它的臉是老鷹身體卻是人
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.50,0:03:30.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,日本也有喔
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.81,0:03:31.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.01,0:03:32.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們看
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.64,0:03:35.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,烏鴉天狗很明顯的就是鳥人啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.48,0:03:37.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么這些全都是外星人嘍？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.11,0:03:40.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其實話也不能說得這么肯定啦
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.28,0:03:42.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是說不定真的有喔
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.25,0:03:44.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快把這些做完吧…\N鳥人…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.19,0:03:53.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.56,0:04:28.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A夢…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.58,0:05:48.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你說什么
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.71,0:05:51.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要像鳥一樣？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.65,0:05:54.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,自由的在天空飛翔？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.65,0:05:55.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,竹蜻蜓拿去
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.95,0:05:56.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是啦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.65,0:05:57.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是說鳥人
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.02,0:05:58.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鳥人
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.89,0:06:00.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,超人？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.09,0:06:02.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,超人不就是…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.91,0:06:29.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,超人 我是哆啦哆啦超人
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.18,0:06:31.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,超人？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.25,0:06:32.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,才不是呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.35,0:06:34.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是像鳥的人啦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.19,0:06:35.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,像鳥的人？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.56,0:06:38.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是說我不想靠引擎或馬達
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.69,0:06:41.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要靠自己的力量在天空飛翔啦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.63,0:06:43.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真了不起
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.00,0:06:47.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這一天終于讓我等到了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.57,0:06:50.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,每次媽媽要你做事\N你就說“快拿出法寶來”
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.87,0:06:53.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,叫你做功課\N你也說“快拿出法寶來”
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.14,0:06:57.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,每次只想輕松不肯吃苦的大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.58,0:07:00.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,總算愿意靠自己的力量…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.95,0:07:04.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你就不知道\N我期盼這一天期盼多久了…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.29,0:07:07.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也知道\N我不能一直這樣下去
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.09,0:07:08.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是太有骨氣了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.72,0:07:09.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.89,0:07:10.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么樣？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.39,0:07:14.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可以讓我靠自己飛起來的法寶\N快拿出來吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.16,0:07:15.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天哪…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.60,0:07:18.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的\N這要靠你自己動手做才對呀
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.80,0:07:19.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也知道啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.04,0:07:23.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看 就是這個
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.10,0:07:24.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我看看
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.24,0:07:27.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看\N我就是想做像這樣的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.54,0:07:30.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 這個是…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.48,0:07:31.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就這么決定
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.75,0:07:32.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,先找材料…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.05,0:07:37.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這種東西怎么可能飛得起來嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.75,0:07:39.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還是先別澆他冷水…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.95,0:08:10.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,做好了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.35,0:08:12.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你做得很好喔
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.72,0:08:15.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們到山上試飛吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.72,0:08:16.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.53,0:08:20.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你真的做得很用心
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.93,0:08:24.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是…你聽我說…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.17,0:08:25.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了 我要飛了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.24,0:08:33.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我飛起來了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.94,0:08:38.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,幸好下面先鋪好氣墊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.55,0:08:45.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你可不要多管閑事喔
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.45,0:08:47.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是好心沒好報
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.32,0:08:49.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,應該飛得起來…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.06,0:08:52.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 人類的力量根本就…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.96,0:08:54.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這次我一定要飛起來
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.33,0:08:55.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,別試了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.35,0:09:12.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.22,0:09:18.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看他這么認真\N我實在無法阻止他啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.99,0:09:23.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不要用氣墊啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.09,0:09:24.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒錯
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.86,0:09:26.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,擺了氣墊我反而容易松懈
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.36,0:09:29.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,開什么玩笑
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.50,0:09:38.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇…飛起來了飛起來了\N根本沒有飛起來
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.37,0:09:40.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人類的力量根本就是不可能的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.38,0:09:43.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我好想靠自己的力量飛起來啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.11,0:09:46.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 我要對你另眼看待了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.75,0:09:48.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,唔 那是…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.88,0:09:51.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.39,0:09:53.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,靜香
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.25,0:09:54.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的小嗶飛走了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.89,0:09:56.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它有沒有飛到這邊來？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.76,0:09:57.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.89,0:09:58.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A夢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.40,0:10:02.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快回來
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.55,0:10:20.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂 你在干么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.15,0:10:21.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胖虎
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.78,0:10:23.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看那邊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.79,0:10:29.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小夫 我們快過去看看
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.93,0:10:32.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我記得是這個方向啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.79,0:10:34.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的太突然了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.46,0:10:36.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他剛才還閃過小嗶呢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.93,0:10:39.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 在那里
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.34,0:10:42.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你沒事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.18,0:10:50.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是…鳥嗎？\N還是人啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.95,0:10:51.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不知道耶
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.35,0:10:54.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這真的是鳥的羽毛耶
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.08,0:10:56.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這么說…是鳥人？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.85,0:10:58.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么可能
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.09,0:11:02.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他怎么會開著這種飛機\N突然從天空冒出來啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.82,0:11:04.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這到底是什么人啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.59,0:11:06.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他好像受傷了耶
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.09,0:11:08.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們想辦法幫幫他吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.86,0:11:11.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要是被人發現的話\N一定會引起一陣騷動的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.60,0:11:14.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,隱形噴霧劑
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.10,0:11:18.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這么一來\N就可以把飛機藏起來了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.71,0:11:20.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 你過來背他
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.98,0:11:22.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 我來背啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.61,0:11:23.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒錯
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.48,0:11:24.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們先帶他回家吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.35,0:11:30.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,搞不好這會是個大事件喔
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.72,0:11:32.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么找不到呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.49,0:11:34.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,奇怪了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.49,0:11:36.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看起來是這個方向沒錯啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.73,0:11:39.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小夫
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.36,0:11:41.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這件事絕對不能告訴任何人喔
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.40,0:11:42.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,當然啰
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.52,0:12:04.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他好像醒過來了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.39,0:12:09.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人…類…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.76,0:12:10.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.03,0:12:12.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,上面在吵什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.93,0:12:14.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,羽毛？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.40,0:12:16.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,該不會…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.26,0:12:18.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又開始偷偷的養什么東西…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.17,0:12:23.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不要怕\N我們不會對你怎么樣
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.90,0:12:25.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的…雪鵝號…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.91,0:12:29.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們弄去哪里了？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.28,0:12:31.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雪…鵝…號？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.05,0:12:32.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他說的是那架飛機吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.28,0:12:35.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們把它藏在\N你剛才摔下來的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.18,0:12:38.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你放心 不會被發現的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.79,0:12:39.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝你們…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.09,0:12:43.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們快帶我去\N雪鵝號藏匿的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.92,0:12:45.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.79,0:12:47.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 糟糕\N媽媽上來了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.30,0:12:56.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.44,0:12:58.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咦 哆啦A夢你怎么啦？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.71,0:13:01.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 我…好像有點發燒…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.11,0:13:03.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又好像沒有…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.08,0:13:08.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又在玩花樣了\N我拿很～苦的藥給你吃
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.95,0:13:11.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 你在那里干什么呀？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.72,0:13:14.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這…里頭什么東西也沒有啦
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.09,0:13:16.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那你就給我讓開
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.59,0:13:18.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要檢查
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.24,0:13:31.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他應該是跑去\N藏飛機的那座山里了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.11,0:13:33.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,趁他還沒被發現的時候…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.34,0:13:35.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對 快走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.98,0:13:38.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想去哪里啊\N大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.51,0:13:40.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,果然你真的想養雞
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.61,0:13:43.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,聽好啊 媽媽絕對不會答應
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.26,0:13:50.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,唉 好個獨家消息就這么飛了…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.99,0:13:51.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天都黑了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.13,0:13:53.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們明天再來找吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.86,0:13:55.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一定是有什么東西掉下來
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.26,0:13:59.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小夫\N這件事也不能讓大雄知道喔
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.27,0:14:00.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道啦
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.51,0:14:09.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到底藏到哪里去了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.51,0:14:14.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我記得是在這附近呀…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.56,0:14:27.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這個聲音…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.80,0:14:28.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在那邊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.66,0:14:29.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快走
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.55,0:14:47.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,已經沒事了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.92,0:14:50.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你明明有翅膀卻飛不起來啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.82,0:14:57.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們人類為什么會飛啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.42,0:14:59.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去漆噴霧劑
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.56,0:15:02.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了 它在這里
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.06,0:15:04.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇 雪鵝號
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.20,0:15:06.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊…都摔壞了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.97,0:15:11.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看來要把這個修理好的話\N可能要花一些時間了…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.07,0:15:13.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們一起來幫你
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.57,0:15:15.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒關系 我自己來就行了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.08,0:15:19.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你到現在還不相信我們啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.59,0:15:26.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝均KA大雄…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.86,0:15:30.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的名字叫古斯基啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.36,0:15:32.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是從哪里來的？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.36,0:15:35.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,該不是從宇宙來的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.36,0:15:38.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是哪里呢…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.87,0:15:42.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這…我不能說
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.97,0:15:47.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我看在飛機還沒修好之前
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.61,0:15:49.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你就暫時先躲在這里好了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.74,0:15:52.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鳥箱型露營膠囊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.61,0:15:54.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么這么小啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.25,0:15:56.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看著好了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.65,0:16:03.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這里的話視野應該也不錯\N就這里好了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.26,0:16:06.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再設置個隨意電梯
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.76,0:16:10.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,本電梯前往鳥箱
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.67,0:16:20.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原來里面這么寬敞啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.77,0:16:24.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其實里面并不大啦\N是我們變小了啦
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.01,0:16:27.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇 這里的視野好棒喔
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.02,0:16:28.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的耶
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.28,0:16:32.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們為什么會有\N這么不可思議的力量呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.15,0:16:34.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其實真正厲害的\N只有哆啦A夢啦
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.29,0:16:37.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嘿…這也沒什么啦
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.93,0:16:48.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小嗶…飛到哪里去了…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.57,0:16:51.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,希望它平安無事…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.94,0:16:55.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,古斯基 你就好好的休息吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.94,0:16:57.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們明天再來找你
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.85,0:17:00.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的謝謝你們
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.19,0:17:12.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要是大家知道我在人類的世界
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.53,0:17:15.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一定會很驚訝吧…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.70,0:17:20.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的沒想到\N我會受到人類的幫助…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.18,0:17:38.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還真有這回事
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.52,0:17:40.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你每次都這樣…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.32,0:17:47.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,背上有翅膀像鳥的人類…\N還說在屋頂上跑呢
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.23,0:17:52.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這一定跟我們\N昨天看到的東西有關連
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.30,0:17:56.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也許就像太郎說的\N是“鳥人外型的外星人”吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.80,0:17:59.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這肯定是個勁爆消息
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.74,0:18:01.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 對了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.04,0:18:03.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道\N不行告訴大雄對不對…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.48,0:18:04.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒錯
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.98,0:18:11.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,古斯基 開始動手修理啦
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.75,0:18:13.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗨 大家早安
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.85,0:18:16.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,早安 昨晚睡得好嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.22,0:18:18.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,幸虧有你們的幫忙\N我的精神都恢復了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.09,0:18:21.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,昨天說好今天要來幫你的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.26,0:18:22.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝你 大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.53,0:18:25.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這個機翼壞成這樣…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.03,0:18:26.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看這個用得上嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.73,0:18:29.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是我自己做的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.77,0:18:31.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我看看
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.04,0:18:35.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然看起來快破掉了…\N應該可以吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.08,0:18:37.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的嗎\N太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.81,0:18:40.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,先等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.98,0:18:42.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,固體燈
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.82,0:18:44.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用它來補強一下
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.49,0:18:47.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 那邊幫我扶一下
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.55,0:18:48.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒問題
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.06,0:18:51.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄他做得好起勁喔
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.73,0:18:56.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 再右邊一點…\N好…可以了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.30,0:18:57.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 你要抓緊喔
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.74,0:19:06.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,完成了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.14,0:19:07.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,接著修螺旋槳
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.84,0:19:08.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.24,0:19:10.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要扶好喔
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.61,0:19:12.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了嗎 我要試嘍
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.58,0:19:15.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 去轉一下踏板看看
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.62,0:19:16.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.79,0:19:21.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 再多轉幾下
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.53,0:19:27.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他們兩個就像兄弟一樣耶
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.63,0:19:30.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了 大功告成了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.03,0:19:32.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣就能飛起來了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.03,0:19:34.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.33,0:19:36.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝你 大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.14,0:19:37.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是太好了 古斯基
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.27,0:19:40.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,現在就來試飛看看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.84,0:19:43.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,開什么玩笑啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.94,0:19:47.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到底是誰說有鳥人外星人的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.35,0:19:48.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是你自己啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.95,0:19:50.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 是我啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.05,0:19:52.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 那是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.29,0:19:56.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看 這不是昨天墜機的殘骸嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.82,0:19:57.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這么說的話…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.86,0:20:00.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,應該還在這附近才對
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.17,0:20:10.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,古斯基 加油喔
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.88,0:20:19.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胖虎
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.45,0:20:20.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊…是外星人
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.88,0:20:24.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小夫 別讓他逃了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.89,0:20:25.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,站住
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.89,0:20:32.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胖虎
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.66,0:20:33.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小夫
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.40,0:20:37.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A夢
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.66,0:20:38.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快用竹蜻蜓
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.47,0:20:47.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,古斯基
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.91,0:20:48.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胖虎
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.68,0:20:49.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小夫
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.41,0:20:55.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇 跟昨天一樣的洞穴…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.45,0:21:00.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胖虎
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.19,0:21:01.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小夫
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.20,0:21:10.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A夢
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.96,0:21:11.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.73,0:21:13.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我猜可能是時空隧道
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.93,0:21:15.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,時空隧道？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.47,0:21:18.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是普通的鳥耶
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.71,0:21:23.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這里到底通往哪里啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.24,0:21:25.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂 這樣很危險耶
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.98,0:21:28.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,均KA要帶我們去哪里啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.25,0:21:29.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,媽媽
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.00,0:21:44.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂 這是哪里啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.93,0:21:46.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快放我們下去
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.27,0:21:48.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇 怎么回事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.74,0:21:52.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快放我們下去
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.98,0:22:01.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,得救了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.98,0:22:03.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胖虎 你看…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.05,0:22:05.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 這些家伙是什么人啊
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.99,0:22:13.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇啊 我們穿過來了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.78,0:22:34.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這到底是什么地方啊
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.48,0:22:37.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 我的竹蜻蜓…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.45,0:22:39.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,電池沒了\N快下去
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.53,0:22:47.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你沒事吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.59,0:22:48.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還好啦
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.87,0:23:04.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你就不知道\N綠色的全都任你挑呢
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.01,0:23:08.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我回來了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.32,0:23:13.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,母雞小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.99,0:23:16.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有你的限時信喔
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.49,0:23:18.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拿去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.33,0:23:19.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,辛苦你了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.63,0:23:22.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇 是公雞先生寄來的耶
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.86,0:23:29.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快一點呀 鸛鳥婆婆\N已經快下蛋了啦
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.10,0:23:31.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.27,0:23:33.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快一點啦
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.64,0:23:37.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嘻 鸛鳥是接生婆耶
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.88,0:23:40.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,塘鵝最適合當郵差先生了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.58,0:23:44.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道了\N這里就是古斯基居住的世界
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.42,0:23:47.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原來真的有鳥人世界耶
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.85,0:23:49.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們別亂動
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.52,0:23:52.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們從哪里來的？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.36,0:23:55.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喔 這幾個都是人類
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.86,0:23:57.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,隊長 這家伙是只貓耶
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.03,0:24:00.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還真的是貓呢
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.10,0:24:05.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,總算有人認出我是貓來了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.87,0:24:10.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A夢\N現在不是感動的時候吧
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.41,0:24:12.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,貓是鳥的大敵
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.55,0:24:13.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,給我抓起來
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.95,0:24:19.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要跑
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.66,0:24:23.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要跑到哪里去才好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.59,0:24:24.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A夢
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.39,0:24:25.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快想想辦法啊
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.40,0:24:30.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,趕路的小貓
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.63,0:24:33.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你叫我嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.93,0:24:35.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A夢 快走呀
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.14,0:24:37.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,趕路的話\N要不要搭駝鳥計程車啊
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.64,0:24:38.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,計程車？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.64,0:24:40.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,先坐上去再說了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.67,0:24:42.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,請問要去哪里呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.14,0:24:43.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,趕快往前走就對了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.34,0:24:45.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.21,0:24:48.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,站住…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.15,0:24:51.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,避免被甩出去請抓緊喔
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.59,0:24:54.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太太 您還滿意嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.92,0:24:57.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我實在太喜歡這個發型了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.92,0:24:58.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝您的光臨
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.16,0:24:59.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,請慢走
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.47,0:25:10.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么有這么粗暴的計程車啊
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.00,0:25:12.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,別跑
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.18,0:25:17.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是氣死我了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.25,0:25:25.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,來 大家排隊過馬路啊
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.39,0:25:26.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么停下來了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.42,0:25:27.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快走呀
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.52,0:25:28.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,現在不行走
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.96,0:25:31.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,過馬路的時候要小心喔
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.23,0:25:36.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊…哆啦A夢
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.70,0:25:38.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他們追上來了啦
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.97,0:25:40.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就走旁邊的小路吧
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.97,0:25:41.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.47,0:25:45.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他們往那邊跑了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.24,0:25:48.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,前面的路會越來越窄
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.04,0:25:50.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,請你們抓緊啊
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.82,0:26:00.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,頭快彎下去
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.50,0:26:10.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不錯吧
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.30,0:26:12.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們已經把警備隊甩掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.50,0:26:13.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝你
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.21,0:26:21.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,請你們保重啊
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.29,0:26:36.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,已經干了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.32,0:26:38.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,接下來該怎么辦哪
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.29,0:26:41.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,總之先去找胖虎他們吧
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.03,0:26:46.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好壯觀的建筑物喔
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.87,0:26:56.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們不要太過分喔
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.54,0:26:57.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 有人來了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.88,0:26:58.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快躲到這里面
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.05,0:27:01.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,說什么我都不會聽的
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.62,0:27:08.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要每次\N一有人類侵入就找我來
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.59,0:27:10.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.56,0:27:14.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們回家吧
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.06,0:27:16.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的 主人
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.30,0:27:20.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,唔…好重啊
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.30,0:27:21.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真搞不懂
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.60,0:27:24.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真搞不懂滋古連度在想什么
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.60,0:27:54.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天我應該不會出門了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.85,0:28:07.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們進去看看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.85,0:28:09.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或許能得到一些情報喔
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.89,0:28:15.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看起來這里好像是個\N考古學家住的地方耶
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.36,0:28:16.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們看
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.12,0:28:17.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太郎給我們看過這個東西
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.92,0:28:19.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好像荷魯斯的像喔
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.13,0:28:23.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這么說的話\N很久以前就跟地球有關…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.13,0:28:27.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是你們啊
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.60,0:28:29.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,古斯基
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.40,0:28:30.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們怎么會在這里？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.14,0:28:33.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們一路追著你結果就…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.91,0:28:36.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這真是稀客啊
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.41,0:28:38.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人類的小孩跟…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.15,0:28:41.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯…一只貍啊
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.18,0:28:43.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我叫哆啦A夢
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.15,0:28:46.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是一只機器貓
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.39,0:28:50.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄跟靜香\N都是我的救命恩人
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.72,0:28:53.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他是我的好朋友貓頭鷹博士
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.43,0:28:54.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.33,0:28:56.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,古斯基
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.33,0:28:58.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你又隨便跑到\N人類的世界去了喔
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.40,0:29:00.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對不起
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.47,0:29:02.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,古斯基 剛才那兩個人呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.50,0:29:05.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可能被烏鴉警備隊抓走了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.19,0:29:28.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放我們去啦
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.86,0:29:29.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可惡
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.93,0:29:31.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要把你們揍得扁扁的
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.20,0:29:38.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,滋古連度長官\N就是這兩個人
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.44,0:29:42.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是他們的老大吧
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.71,0:29:44.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快放我們出去
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.24,0:29:47.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這么兇暴 的確是人類
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.91,0:29:49.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,長官 該怎么處置他們？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.72,0:29:52.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,既然是人類的話那就不必審判
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.45,0:29:54.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,立刻處刑
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.46,0:29:56.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,處刑？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.39,0:29:59.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們怎么可以隨便決定呢
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.53,0:30:00.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,隨便決定？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.96,0:30:01.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是什么蠢話
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.20,0:30:03.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為你們人類的一意孤行
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.23,0:30:06.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,才會造成\N無計其數的鳥類受到迫害
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.73,0:30:08.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明天就處刑
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.20,0:30:11.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哼 可惡
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.54,0:30:12.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,別走
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.47,0:30:14.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,媽媽
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.74,0:30:16.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鳥托邦…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.28,0:30:17.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒錯
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.01,0:30:22.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鳥托邦是從人類的世界中\N被隔絕出來的
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.45,0:30:23.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么是隔絕啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.98,0:30:26.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,意思是離很遠不能往來
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.25,0:30:28.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這里跟你們的世界
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.49,0:30:31.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是由一個叫鳥航道的超空間\N連接起來的
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.29,0:30:35.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其中一個\N是跟后山連接在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.43,0:30:37.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是為什么我們不知道呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.26,0:30:42.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這個入口只有\N鳥類跟我們鳥人知道而已
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.94,0:30:45.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且也不會停留在同一個地方
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.01,0:30:48.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以才一直沒有被人發現
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.51,0:30:49.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.08,0:30:51.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們要趕快想辦法\N救救胖虎跟小夫啊
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.51,0:30:53.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 對喔
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.35,0:30:54.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.51,0:30:58.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不過 就這樣走出去的話\N馬上又會被追捕
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.02,0:31:01.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.75,0:31:03.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,新型小鳥帽
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.52,0:31:08.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要戴上這個\N我們就可以變成跟鳥人一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.30,0:31:12.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的是鴨子
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.23,0:31:14.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的是天鵝
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.87,0:31:20.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喔…真是太神奇了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.04,0:31:21.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這可以飛嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.31,0:31:22.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,當然可以嘍
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.84,0:31:24.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的耶…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.75,0:31:27.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我們就出發吧
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.81,0:31:28.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,古斯基
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.58,0:31:29.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你可以幫忙帶路嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.98,0:31:33.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是我的雪鵝號又故障了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.05,0:31:35.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又壞掉啦
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.09,0:31:36.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我載你好了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.56,0:31:39.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A夢\N你可以嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.56,0:31:41.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我們走嘍
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.56,0:31:46.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哈 這哪飛得起來嘛\N我戴的是企鵝的帽子
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.10,0:31:50.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你放心 這次我已經換成白鴿帽了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.07,0:31:57.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們要對我們處什么刑啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.34,0:32:00.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,屁股打一千下
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.58,0:32:01.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,媽媽…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.85,0:32:03.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快放我們出去
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.62,0:32:04.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,別作夢了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.12,0:32:06.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喔 你出將軍
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.85,0:32:08.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我贏了…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.09,0:32:10.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沉底球
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.16,0:32:12.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他們兩個等一下會沉下去
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.89,0:32:14.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們趁機去拿鑰匙
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.86,0:32:15.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.70,0:32:17.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.80,0:32:20.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 就差那么一步
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.37,0:32:22.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.64,0:32:27.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,趁現在 快呀
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.61,0:32:29.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂 怎么搞的\N胖虎
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.38,0:32:30.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂 怎么搞的\N小夫
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.54,0:32:31.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喔 我的好朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.08,0:32:33.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.91,0:32:35.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,趁現在還沒人來 快逃呀
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.55,0:32:36.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 你不是…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.08,0:32:40.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂 原來是你在搞鬼\N給我記住
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.39,0:32:41.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,遺忘草
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.12,0:32:44.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 讓你們忘得一干二凈
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.89,0:32:48.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們剛才在做什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.90,0:32:49.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.90,0:32:51.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家動作快一點
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.40,0:32:53.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再見…要保重喔…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.90,0:32:57.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我受夠了 我要回家啦
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.40,0:33:00.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們可能還要再多調查一下
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.91,0:33:01.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對不起
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.64,0:33:04.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都是我不好 害了大家
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.48,0:33:05.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,才不是呢
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.18,0:33:10.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,難得能交上古斯基這個朋友\N我們再多待一下嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.92,0:33:12.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原來你叫古斯基啊
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.65,0:33:13.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我叫胖虎
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.09,0:33:15.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其實我們兩個也有責任
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.96,0:33:17.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么責任啊
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.16,0:33:20.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,難得來到這里\N我們就多開開眼界吧
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.59,0:33:23.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A夢\N你也給我們那種帽子吧
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.66,0:33:24.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,當然沒問題
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.20,0:33:26.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拿去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.10,0:33:31.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哈哈 啄木鳥耶\N太適合你了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.77,0:33:35.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的是…信天翁耶
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.44,0:33:37.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,信天翁又怎么樣
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.71,0:33:40.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了好了\N別吵了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.98,0:33:44.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咦 胖虎人呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.45,0:33:47.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,信天翁都要先助跑才行
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.29,0:33:52.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,成功了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.69,0:33:54.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,讓你們久等啦
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.24,0:34:04.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原來事情是這樣啊
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.24,0:34:07.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是為什么\N他們一聽到我們是人類
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.91,0:34:09.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就對我們這么不友善啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.58,0:34:11.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是因為…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.54,0:34:14.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,滋古連度長官\N非常憎恨人類的關系
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.18,0:34:17.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,憎恨人類\N為什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.92,0:34:19.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他曾經被槍打中
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.79,0:34:25.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鳥托邦有一支候鳥巡邏隊
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.29,0:34:29.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他們的任務是監視世界的候鳥
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.17,0:34:37.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,候鳥具有特別的能力\N所以不會迷路找不到方向
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.97,0:34:41.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,當然其中也會有迷路的候鳥
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.21,0:34:47.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,將這些候鳥引導到正確的航道\N或是保護他們的安全
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.61,0:34:49.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這都是候鳥巡邏隊的工作
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.45,0:34:57.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,滋古連度就是在巡邏當中\N被無情的人類用槍打中翅膀
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.56,0:34:58.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好過分喔
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.13,0:35:02.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,從那個時候開始\N他就變得相當憎恨人類
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.23,0:35:07.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,本來地球上的鳥類\N跟人類就是要和平共處
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.13,0:35:09.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,現在最重要的
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.84,0:35:12.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家要想想\N能為彼此做些什么事
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.14,0:35:14.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不管是我們鳥人
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.94,0:35:16.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或你們人類都一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.04,0:35:18.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,博士說的一點也沒錯
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.01,0:35:20.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對不起
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.75,0:35:21.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你別在意
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.91,0:35:25.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其實我也知道\N也有像你們這樣的人類
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.62,0:35:27.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝你們幫助古斯基
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.25,0:35:31.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雪鵝號\N是博士跟我一起做出來的
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.56,0:35:32.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒有啦
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.43,0:35:35.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其實幾乎都是\N古斯基一個人完成的
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.43,0:35:37.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,考古學才是我的專長啊
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.56,0:35:40.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,難怪這里全都是一些舊東西
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.07,0:35:43.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,千萬別碰那個東西
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.97,0:35:45.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對不起 嚇到你了
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.57,0:35:49.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是個非常古老的石碑\N很容易就會碎掉的
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.61,0:35:54.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這上面刻的傳聞\N或許會改變鳥托邦未來的命運
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.08,0:35:59.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是去年\N從鳥棲木的根挖掘出來的
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.79,0:36:01.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鳥棲木？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.09,0:36:01.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒錯
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.52,0:36:05.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們看…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.66,0:36:07.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.56,0:36:13.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它的頂端一直都有云籠罩著
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.13,0:36:15.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家把它叫做“煙環”
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.60,0:36:17.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到現在還沒有人進去過呢
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.91,0:36:29.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鳥棲木在我們鳥人誕生的時候\N就一直持續的成長
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.12,0:36:34.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是 它到底有多高\N頂端上面有什么東西
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.15,0:36:36.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒有人知道
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.45,0:37:00.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這里就是我家
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.98,0:37:04.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你沒回家不會挨罵呀？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.22,0:37:05.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不會啦
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.25,0:37:08.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為我是在練習飛行啊
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.09,0:37:10.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快進來吧
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.29,0:37:12.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,古斯基
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.46,0:37:14.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你到底跑哪去了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.79,0:37:16.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 你聽我說啦…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.70,0:37:17.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你叫米露啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.63,0:37:21.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咦？是你的新朋友啊
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.70,0:37:24.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們好 我是住在隔壁的米露
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.17,0:37:26.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你好 我們是…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.67,0:37:29.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把古斯基帶出去玩的\N就是你們對吧
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.81,0:37:30.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是啦
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.81,0:37:32.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我去練習開雪鵝號啦…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.28,0:37:35.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,別找藉口了\N也不跟我講一聲就跑出去
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.98,0:37:38.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她好像是古斯基的女朋友喲
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.22,0:37:39.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒錯沒錯
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.19,0:37:44.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇 真是熱鬧啊
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.02,0:37:47.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,歡迎古斯基的朋友來家里玩
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.83,0:37:49.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們就留下來吃晚飯吧
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.10,0:37:52.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我媽媽做的菜很好吃喔
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.37,0:37:55.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哼 就知道撒嬌\N你要多多反省才對
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.34,0:37:58.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,媽媽\N爸爸人呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.37,0:38:02.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,滋古連度長官\N跟巴比倫隊長現在剛好來家里呢
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.11,0:38:04.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,滋古連度長官在我們家啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.35,0:38:13.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我希望你能在這份文件上簽名
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.59,0:38:15.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.19,0:38:19.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是為了保護我們鳥托邦\N跟地球上的鳥類
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.09,0:38:23.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不被人類迫害的\N最終計劃同意書
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.36,0:38:29.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,現在就剩下貓頭鷹博士\N還有你這位環境長官
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.24,0:38:33.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要簽了名就能在議會通過
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.54,0:38:34.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很遺憾的
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.64,0:38:37.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不贊成這個計劃
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.24,0:38:39.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,請您再考慮清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.21,0:38:42.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人類確實是我們鳥類的勁敵
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.15,0:38:46.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但也不能因為這樣\N就草率決定
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.26,0:38:54.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好好吃喔
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.79,0:38:56.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你還是這么會吃
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.73,0:38:58.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很好吃嘛 怎么樣？
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.60,0:39:00.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再來一碗
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.20,0:39:00.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.07,0:39:01.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也要
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.20,0:39:02.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.64,0:39:06.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再來一碗
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.44,0:39:08.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再來一碗
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.47,0:39:09.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.15,0:39:13.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再來一碗
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.81,0:39:14.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.48,0:39:16.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,古斯基也很厲害喔
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.95,0:39:19.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為我要參加伊卡洛斯耐力賽
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.25,0:39:21.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不多增強一些體力的話\N那怎么行
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.49,0:39:23.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么是伊卡洛斯耐力賽啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.49,0:39:26.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是候鳥巡邏隊的入隊測驗
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.33,0:39:30.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是以傳說中的鳥人\N伊卡洛斯命名的
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.20,0:39:36.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要加入巡邏隊的話
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.80,0:39:41.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要通過技術速度\N還有持久力的比賽來決定
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.31,0:39:44.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也會帶著雪鵝號參加的
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.81,0:39:47.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以你才一直不斷的練習
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.52,0:39:51.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不會用翅膀飛的人
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.35,0:39:54.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有可能在\N伊卡洛斯耐力賽中獲勝嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.45,0:39:57.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這未免也太天真了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.86,0:40:00.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,總之你就多盡力練習吧
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.63,0:40:03.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你什么意思
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.90,0:40:05.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,米露
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.16,0:40:07.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,古斯基是有原因才飛不起來的
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.33,0:40:08.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這也是沒有辦法的事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.03,0:40:10.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有原因？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.85,0:40:54.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為這樣所以…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.45,0:40:58.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,每次當我想用自己的翅膀\N飛看看的時候
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.32,0:41:00.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就會想起\N當初那種恐怖的感覺
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.09,0:41:02.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道那種感覺
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.59,0:41:04.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,自從我的耳朵被咬過一次之后
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.79,0:41:06.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到現在還很怕老鼠呢
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.89,0:41:10.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不過 沒關系\N我還有雪鵝號啊
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.00,0:41:11.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.96,0:41:15.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再怎么說你都是\N靠自己的力量飛起來的嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.07,0:41:16.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,既然有這個難得的機會
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.80,0:41:19.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們就一起去幫古斯基加油吧
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.37,0:41:20.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.54,0:41:21.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對了
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.77,0:41:23.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們也來參加比賽吧
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.11,0:41:27.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,聽起來滿有意思的喔
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.61,0:41:28.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你真的要參加啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.11,0:41:30.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是當然的嘍
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.42,0:41:32.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我決定要參加兩卡洛斯耐力賽
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.12,0:41:35.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胖虎 是伊卡洛斯啦
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.55,0:41:37.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,管它一卡兩卡還不都一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.62,0:41:38.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,差太多了啦
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.36,0:41:43.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明天就開始練習吧
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.86,0:41:46.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 今天晚上早一點睡吧
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.50,0:41:47.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,先等一下好嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.07,0:41:48.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.37,0:41:52.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,古斯基 廁所在哪里啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.04,0:41:53.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.41,0:41:56.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯…下樓之后…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.41,0:42:00.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 找到了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.15,0:42:03.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咦？我走錯了嗎…？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:04.65,0:42:07.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 那是什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.12,0:42:12.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鳥蛋啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:23.77,0:42:26.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了…發生什么事了…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.77,0:42:27.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇…好可愛喲
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.97,0:42:29.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,長得好像小夫喔
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.58,0:42:31.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爸爸 是個男孩子呢
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.01,0:42:34.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就是我的弟弟嘍
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.68,0:42:37.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他想怎么樣嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.13,0:42:50.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是這個…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.63,0:42:53.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,腓…尼…基…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.40,0:42:55.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,果真如此…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.87,0:43:01.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,腓尼基…太可怕了…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.47,0:43:03.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是誰？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.68,0:43:08.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是我聽錯了嗎…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.52,0:43:13.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,腓尼基？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:14.05,0:43:16.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你確定沒聽錯？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.59,0:43:17.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.59,0:43:22.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,貓頭鷹博士邊看著石碑\N嘴里是這么說的
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.33,0:43:25.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,腓尼基的存在終于被證實了
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.53,0:43:29.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,長官
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.34,0:43:30.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,腓尼基是指…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.64,0:43:34.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被封印在遙遠古代\N一股強勢的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.01,0:43:38.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,貓頭鷹博士\N在我還尊他為師的時候
Dialogue: 0,0:43:39.11,0:43:43.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就已經投入畢生心血\N從事腓尼基的研究
Dialogue: 0,0:43:43.18,0:43:45.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這么說 要是我們\N能得到這個力量的話…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.39,0:43:49.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不管是那個頑固的環境長官
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.25,0:43:50.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或是反對我們的人
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.02,0:43:53.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也都對我們束手無策
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.66,0:43:54.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,即使…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:55.23,0:43:58.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那幾個該處刑的人類也一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.40,0:44:01.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 屬下該死
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.50,0:44:04.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,負責看守的人\N都不記得發生什么事了
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.21,0:44:09.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們還求證到\N有另外兩個人類跟一只貓
Dialogue: 0,0:44:10.08,0:44:14.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要是讓人類世界知道\N我們的計劃那就麻煩了
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.78,0:44:16.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還不快去把他們抓回來
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.65,0:44:17.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的…
Dialogue: 0,0:44:40.44,0:44:45.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這些從人類世界帶過來的鳥\N在這里自由自在的生活
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.08,0:44:47.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有受傷的鳥
Dialogue: 0,0:44:48.01,0:44:51.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就等它們的傷恢復之后\N再讓它們回去原來的世界
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.99,0:44:56.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我看那些企鵝好像是\N電視上報導的失蹤企鵝耶
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.46,0:44:57.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一點都沒錯耶
Dialogue: 0,0:44:57.76,0:45:00.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 是朱鷺耶\N好漂亮喔
Dialogue: 0,0:45:00.66,0:45:05.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,讓一些快要絕種的鳥類繁殖\N再讓它們回去人類的世界
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.73,0:45:09.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這就是我那個\N身為環境長官的父親的工作
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.80,0:45:12.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小嗶
Dialogue: 0,0:45:15.64,0:45:17.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了 你平安無事
Dialogue: 0,0:45:17.14,0:45:18.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:45:18.68,0:45:20.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我還以為它跑到哪里去了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:45:21.61,0:45:23.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要開始練習嘍
Dialogue: 0,0:45:25.65,0:45:26.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們聽清楚喔
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.79,0:45:30.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那邊那個中央廳\N是伊卡洛耐力賽的起點
Dialogue: 0,0:45:30.66,0:45:33.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,依照路標飛完一圈\N然后折返
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.59,0:45:39.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,之后在鳥棲木的煙環正下方\N插上自己的羽毛
Dialogue: 0,0:45:40.37,0:45:41.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這還不簡單
Dialogue: 0,0:45:41.67,0:45:42.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那你就錯了
Dialogue: 0,0:45:43.17,0:45:45.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,途中設置了許多障礙物
Dialogue: 0,0:45:45.87,0:45:48.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,總而言之速度是最基本的要求
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.87,0:45:51.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們來比賽看誰先飛到\N對面的山崖吧
Dialogue: 0,0:45:53.28,0:45:54.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走嘍
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.98,0:46:00.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走嘍
Dialogue: 0,0:46:01.15,0:46:02.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,古斯基 出發嘍
Dialogue: 0,0:46:02.82,0:46:04.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,開始
Dialogue: 0,0:46:05.09,0:46:07.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,古斯基 你可以吧
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.36,0:46:08.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,感覺好棒喔
Dialogue: 0,0:46:08.99,0:46:10.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的感覺好棒喔
Dialogue: 0,0:46:14.73,0:46:16.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,飛的好快喔
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.11,0:46:25.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我才不會輸呢\N看我的
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.22,0:46:35.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你真的有夠快的
Dialogue: 0,0:46:35.72,0:46:38.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,速度不夠快的\N話根本無法獲勝
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.03,0:46:41.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我非參加不可嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:46:41.73,0:46:43.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我看我還是算了
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.26,0:46:45.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也是
Dialogue: 0,0:46:46.10,0:46:48.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,古斯基 我一定要拿到第一名
Dialogue: 0,0:46:49.40,0:46:50.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很好
Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.24,0:46:51.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么大家再飛個十趟吧
Dialogue: 0,0:46:52.24,0:46:53.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,十趟啊
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.00,0:47:23.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我有信心 我相信\N明天我一定會獲勝的
Dialogue: 0,0:47:28.24,0:47:30.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,完成了
Dialogue: 0,0:47:32.65,0:47:33.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那個是誰
Dialogue: 0,0:47:34.88,0:47:36.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們想要做什么
Dialogue: 0,0:47:37.88,0:47:38.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快住手
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.95,0:48:06.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,各位觀眾請注意
Dialogue: 0,0:48:06.75,0:48:08.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鳥托邦最盛大的活動
Dialogue: 0,0:48:08.75,0:48:12.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伊卡洛斯耐力賽\N的比賽時間即將到來
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.92,0:48:15.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在中央貴賓席上
Dialogue: 0,0:48:15.49,0:48:20.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,本大會委員長大老鷹總理\N以及各級長官也都列席參加
Dialogue: 0,0:48:20.46,0:48:23.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,各個參賽者\N已經都集合在起跑點上
Dialogue: 0,0:48:25.63,0:48:26.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家加油
Dialogue: 0,0:48:28.64,0:48:29.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看我的厲害
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.77,0:48:31.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我會全力以赴的
Dialogue: 0,0:48:31.10,0:48:33.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,貓頭鷹博士好像沒有來耶
Dialogue: 0,0:48:33.44,0:48:35.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他可能正在忙著他的研究吧
Dialogue: 0,0:48:35.54,0:48:37.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,古斯基 加油
Dialogue: 0,0:48:39.28,0:48:40.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂 古斯基
Dialogue: 0,0:48:40.78,0:48:43.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你也要出場比賽啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.55,0:48:47.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你以為用這個廢物\N就可以獲勝嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:48:47.15,0:48:49.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要是你能飛完全程的話\N我服了你
Dialogue: 0,0:48:49.56,0:48:50.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們兩個…
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.96,0:48:53.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要是男子漢的話\N別只靠那張嘴巴
Dialogue: 0,0:48:53.16,0:48:54.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家拿出實力來比個高下吧
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.00,0:48:55.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你說什么
Dialogue: 0,0:48:56.16,0:48:58.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,米露 你也要出場比賽啊
Dialogue: 0,0:48:59.07,0:49:00.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這還用問嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:49:00.37,0:49:02.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是負責照顧古斯基的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:49:02.80,0:49:03.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原來是這樣啊
Dialogue: 0,0:49:06.01,0:49:06.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,才不是呢
Dialogue: 0,0:49:07.01,0:49:08.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們等著瞧好了
Dialogue: 0,0:49:08.51,0:49:09.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,米露
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.71,0:49:10.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,讓各位久等了
Dialogue: 0,0:49:11.04,0:49:13.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,現在請大老鷹總理\N來為大家說幾句話
Dialogue: 0,0:49:19.32,0:49:26.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,現在將開始舉行伊卡洛斯\N候鳥巡邏隊的入隊測驗
Dialogue: 0,0:49:32.80,0:49:37.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,測驗結果的判定\N由巴比倫隊長全權負責
Dialogue: 0,0:49:42.44,0:49:45.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,除了選手以外\N其他人請退出比賽場外
Dialogue: 0,0:49:46.38,0:49:47.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家加油喔
Dialogue: 0,0:49:54.89,0:49:56.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,個位選手 請就定位
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.73,0:50:02.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,預備…
Dialogue: 0,0:50:04.36,0:50:05.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,開始
Dialogue: 0,0:50:20.58,0:50:22.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,各個選手幾乎同時起飛
Dialogue: 0,0:50:24.35,0:50:26.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到底誰是第一個飛回來的呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:50:27.12,0:50:30.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最后在鳥棲木上\N插上羽毛的人又會是誰呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:50:42.64,0:50:43.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是那里
Dialogue: 0,0:51:11.20,0:51:14.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,唉 我已經失去資格了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:51:21.98,0:51:23.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你這個頑固的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:51:23.81,0:51:25.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是不可能獲勝的
Dialogue: 0,0:51:29.55,0:51:30.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好厲害喔
Dialogue: 0,0:51:34.62,0:51:35.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看我的
Dialogue: 0,0:51:42.63,0:51:43.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好險哪
Dialogue: 0,0:51:47.13,0:51:48.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小夫 你沒事吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:51:48.77,0:51:49.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還好啦
Dialogue: 0,0:52:56.64,0:52:57.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,米露
Dialogue: 0,0:52:58.41,0:52:59.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我沒事
Dialogue: 0,0:52:59.41,0:53:00.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們先走
Dialogue: 0,0:53:16.79,0:53:20.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,米露 這里很危險\N趕快離開
Dialogue: 0,0:53:28.10,0:53:30.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,已經看不到古斯基他們了
Dialogue: 0,0:53:30.87,0:53:32.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,米露 你沒事吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:53:33.31,0:53:38.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我翅膀被剛才的蜘蛛絲纏到\N變得不好飛了
Dialogue: 0,0:53:38.55,0:53:39.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們先走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:53:41.95,0:53:43.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,古斯基
Dialogue: 0,0:53:43.25,0:53:46.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的希望都寄托在你身上了
Dialogue: 0,0:53:59.83,0:54:02.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,第一組領先的選手已經回來了
Dialogue: 0,0:54:02.84,0:54:06.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,接著就是要\N一股作氣的沖上鳥棲木
Dialogue: 0,0:54:25.23,0:54:25.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可惡
Dialogue: 0,0:54:48.68,0:54:49.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你太奸詐了
Dialogue: 0,0:54:49.82,0:54:52.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,竟然用這種道具想要輕松過關
Dialogue: 0,0:55:10.90,0:55:12.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,古斯基…
Dialogue: 0,0:55:13.34,0:55:14.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我絕不會認輸的
Dialogue: 0,0:55:50.84,0:55:51.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,同時到達
Dialogue: 0,0:55:51.84,0:55:54.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,優勝者是\N燕太郎選手跟古斯基選手
Dialogue: 0,0:55:55.35,0:55:58.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,優勝者是\N燕太郎選手跟古斯基選手
Dialogue: 0,0:55:58.89,0:55:59.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,古斯基 成功了
Dialogue: 0,0:56:00.12,0:56:02.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能夠優勝實在是太厲害了
Dialogue: 0,0:56:03.29,0:56:05.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爸爸 古斯基這孩子…
Dialogue: 0,0:56:05.49,0:56:07.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:56:17.44,0:56:22.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,讓我們用最熱烈的掌聲\N恭喜燕太郎選手跟古斯基選手
Dialogue: 0,0:56:22.78,0:56:26.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,并且也給參賽選手\N一些鼓勵的掌聲
Dialogue: 0,0:56:30.28,0:56:32.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,古斯基 成功了
Dialogue: 0,0:56:32.25,0:56:35.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胖虎跟小夫也盡力了
Dialogue: 0,0:56:35.29,0:56:37.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我比大雄厲害吧
Dialogue: 0,0:56:37.42,0:56:39.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也是一樣 大雄太差勁了
Dialogue: 0,0:56:39.96,0:56:41.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是因為…
Dialogue: 0,0:56:45.60,0:56:47.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,剛才的比賽結果有更動
Dialogue: 0,0:56:49.54,0:56:52.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,現在請巴比倫隊長為大家發表
Dialogue: 0,0:56:52.34,0:56:53.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如同各位看到的
Dialogue: 0,0:56:53.97,0:56:57.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,古斯基選手在這次比賽中\N的確表現相當出色
Dialogue: 0,0:56:57.78,0:57:00.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是他的飛行\N并不是靠自己的翅膀
Dialogue: 0,0:57:00.91,0:57:02.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而是靠其他道具來完成的
Dialogue: 0,0:57:03.18,0:57:07.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在這種情況下我們可以認定\N他是真正的優勝者嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:57:07.85,0:57:11.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為了不讓偉大的伊卡洛斯\N的名譽受到屈辱
Dialogue: 0,0:57:11.92,0:57:14.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們宣布古斯基選手失去這個資格
Dialogue: 0,0:57:16.20,0:57:19.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,優勝者就燕太郎選手一個人
Dialogue: 0,0:57:22.07,0:57:23.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哪有這種事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:57:23.24,0:57:24.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太過分了
Dialogue: 0,0:57:24.14,0:57:25.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有沒有搞錯啊
Dialogue: 0,0:57:26.01,0:57:26.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,另外
Dialogue: 0,0:57:27.24,0:57:30.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,凡是靠自己的翅膀\N飛完全程的選手
Dialogue: 0,0:57:30.88,0:57:33.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,全部都有資格加入巡邏隊的行列
Dialogue: 0,0:57:33.81,0:57:34.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,報告完畢
Dialogue: 0,0:57:39.59,0:57:41.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,靠自己的翅膀…
Dialogue: 0,0:58:01.64,0:58:02.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,博士
Dialogue: 0,0:58:02.48,0:58:04.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,請原諒我下屬的無禮
Dialogue: 0,0:58:05.98,0:58:09.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,多虧你多年的研究\N讓腓尼基的力量成為我的東西
Dialogue: 0,0:58:10.88,0:58:14.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這么一來所有的一切\N都會照我的預定完成
Dialogue: 0,0:58:15.12,0:58:15.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可恨的人類啊
Dialogue: 0,0:58:16.19,0:58:17.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們就等著瞧吧
Dialogue: 0,0:58:18.62,0:58:20.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我復仇的時機來了
Dialogue: 0,0:58:23.30,0:58:23.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,巴比倫
Dialogue: 0,0:58:24.13,0:58:27.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明天一早立刻出動巡邏隊
Dialogue: 0,0:58:28.27,0:58:29.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:58:46.89,0:58:50.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最后我還是要\N靠自己的翅膀飛起來才行哪
Dialogue: 0,0:58:51.06,0:58:53.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A夢\N你能不能想想辦法？
Dialogue: 0,0:58:53.93,0:58:55.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這的確是有點難啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:58:57.43,0:58:58.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們看
Dialogue: 0,0:58:58.53,0:59:00.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們明天就要出動了耶
Dialogue: 0,0:59:00.43,0:59:01.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要再說啦
Dialogue: 0,0:59:01.80,0:59:04.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們也稍微體諒一下\N古斯基的心情好不好
Dialogue: 0,0:59:19.45,0:59:22.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,古斯基 把自己關在房間里
Dialogue: 0,0:59:23.12,0:59:25.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還是讓他靜一靜吧
Dialogue: 0,0:59:25.96,0:59:29.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我總覺得古斯基\N這次被宣布失去資格的背后
Dialogue: 0,0:59:29.56,0:59:31.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好像有什么隱情喔
Dialogue: 0,0:59:32.57,0:59:34.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我有這種感覺
Dialogue: 0,0:59:40.07,0:59:41.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A夢 靜香
Dialogue: 0,0:59:42.88,0:59:44.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,古斯基不見了
Dialogue: 0,0:59:55.49,0:59:56.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,從現在開始
Dialogue: 0,0:59:56.96,1:00:01.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這支新的候鳥巡邏隊\N即將執行首次的任務
Dialogue: 0,1:00:02.09,1:00:03.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不管在什么情況下
Dialogue: 0,1:00:03.96,1:00:05.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,絕對要服從命令
Dialogue: 0,1:00:05.80,1:00:06.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知道嗎
Dialogue: 0,1:00:07.03,1:00:08.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知道
Dialogue: 0,1:00:08.37,1:00:10.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們都是被挑選出來勇者
Dialogue: 0,1:00:10.77,1:00:14.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在首次任務中\N要盡情發揮你們的力量
Dialogue: 0,1:00:14.97,1:00:17.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,候鳥巡邏隊 出動
Dialogue: 0,1:00:35.90,1:00:37.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,找到古斯基了嗎？
Dialogue: 0,1:00:37.26,1:00:37.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒有耶
Dialogue: 0,1:00:38.26,1:00:39.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都沒有人看到他
Dialogue: 0,1:00:39.93,1:00:41.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他到底跑哪去了
Dialogue: 0,1:00:41.77,1:00:44.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去貓頭鷹博士家找過了嗎？
Dialogue: 0,1:00:44.77,1:00:45.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對喔
Dialogue: 0,1:00:45.34,1:00:46.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們去看看吧
Dialogue: 0,1:00:46.07,1:00:46.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,1:00:47.77,1:00:49.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,貓頭鷹博士也不在耶
Dialogue: 0,1:00:49.31,1:00:50.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 怎么會…
Dialogue: 0,1:00:51.28,1:00:52.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到底發生什么事了
Dialogue: 0,1:00:54.15,1:00:55.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這根羽毛是警備隊的…
Dialogue: 0,1:00:56.02,1:00:59.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是博士很很重視的石碑碎片
Dialogue: 0,1:01:00.32,1:01:02.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,博士一定是在滋古連度長官那里
Dialogue: 0,1:01:03.02,1:01:05.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這件事情 果然是有問題
Dialogue: 0,1:01:05.66,1:01:07.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們要先找到古斯基才行啊
Dialogue: 0,1:01:41.69,1:01:42.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不行了
Dialogue: 0,1:01:46.10,1:01:47.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,古斯基
Dialogue: 0,1:01:49.40,1:01:50.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜托你們不要管我
Dialogue: 0,1:01:51.34,1:01:52.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想自己試試看
Dialogue: 0,1:01:53.24,1:01:56.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不管怎么樣\N我一定要靠自己的翅膀飛起來
Dialogue: 0,1:01:56.78,1:01:57.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,古斯基
Dialogue: 0,1:01:57.78,1:01:59.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,博士被抓走了
Dialogue: 0,1:02:00.41,1:02:01.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的嗎
Dialogue: 0,1:02:01.38,1:02:03.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他是你的好朋友不是嗎
Dialogue: 0,1:02:03.48,1:02:06.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家同心協力的話\N一定可以把他救出來的
Dialogue: 0,1:02:07.12,1:02:07.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:02:08.29,1:02:08.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:02:09.02,1:02:11.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有時你還滿會講話的嘛
Dialogue: 0,1:02:11.36,1:02:12.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哪里
Dialogue: 0,1:02:12.43,1:02:15.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,古斯基\N你有沒有什么線索呢？
Dialogue: 0,1:02:15.63,1:02:18.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也許石碑上的文字\N已經解讀出來了
Dialogue: 0,1:02:18.93,1:02:21.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,時光包袱
Dialogue: 0,1:02:21.63,1:02:23.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這個可以讓\N毀掉的石碑再恢復原狀
Dialogue: 0,1:02:24.64,1:02:26.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要是能知道上寫什么就好了
Dialogue: 0,1:02:27.17,1:02:29.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就用翻譯蒟蒻啊
Dialogue: 0,1:02:30.61,1:02:31.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對喔
Dialogue: 0,1:02:31.74,1:02:33.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我怎么會把這個法寶給忘了呢
Dialogue: 0,1:02:34.55,1:02:36.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,翻譯蒟蒻
Dialogue: 0,1:02:37.38,1:02:38.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯…我知道了
Dialogue: 0,1:02:38.95,1:02:40.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,上面寫什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:02:41.02,1:02:44.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,腓尼基聳立于北方盡頭
Dialogue: 0,1:02:44.96,1:02:47.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拉拉亞多山的龍之谷底下
Dialogue: 0,1:02:47.89,1:02:49.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,龍之谷？
Dialogue: 0,1:02:50.70,1:02:54.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,腓尼基的力量\N好比神的強大力量
Dialogue: 0,1:02:56.17,1:02:59.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,假使喚醒腓尼基的力量的話…
Dialogue: 0,1:02:59.44,1:03:01.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到這里就沒了
Dialogue: 0,1:03:01.54,1:03:04.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,腓尼基的力量\N指的到底是什么呢
Dialogue: 0,1:03:04.31,1:03:05.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不知道
Dialogue: 0,1:03:05.78,1:03:08.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不過 這么一來全都明白了
Dialogue: 0,1:03:08.28,1:03:10.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,滋古連度想要利用\N腓尼基的強大力量
Dialogue: 0,1:03:11.48,1:03:14.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,企圖將鳥托邦占為己有
Dialogue: 0,1:03:15.09,1:03:15.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伊卡洛斯
Dialogue: 0,1:03:16.06,1:03:17.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快去告訴伊卡洛斯
Dialogue: 0,1:03:18.42,1:03:21.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伊卡洛斯一定會知道\N腓尼基的力量是什么
Dialogue: 0,1:03:21.93,1:03:24.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伊卡洛斯不是傳說中的鳥人嗎？
Dialogue: 0,1:03:24.83,1:03:26.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他不是古代的人嗎？
Dialogue: 0,1:03:27.50,1:03:29.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我聽貓頭鷹博士說過…
Dialogue: 0,1:03:30.74,1:03:31.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他人在監獄島
Dialogue: 0,1:03:37.58,1:03:38.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伊卡洛斯為了負起
Dialogue: 0,1:03:39.31,1:03:43.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,滋古連度在候鳥巡邏隊時\N遭人類槍擊的責任
Dialogue: 0,1:03:43.68,1:03:45.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,自愿被關進監獄島
Dialogue: 0,1:04:22.46,1:04:23.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伊卡洛斯
Dialogue: 0,1:04:25.79,1:04:26.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伊卡洛斯
Dialogue: 0,1:04:26.66,1:04:27.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你就是伊卡洛斯吧
Dialogue: 0,1:04:29.96,1:04:31.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伊卡洛斯 請你幫助我們
Dialogue: 0,1:04:32.47,1:04:35.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,貓頭鷹博士被滋古連度抓走了
Dialogue: 0,1:04:35.90,1:04:38.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去年被挖掘出來的石碑上寫說
Dialogue: 0,1:04:39.24,1:04:41.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,腓尼基被封印在龍之谷
Dialogue: 0,1:04:44.48,1:04:45.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,滋古連度知道之后…
Dialogue: 0,1:04:47.95,1:04:50.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伊卡洛斯\N請助我們一臂之力
Dialogue: 0,1:04:50.45,1:04:51.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,腓尼基…
Dialogue: 0,1:04:51.98,1:04:54.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再這樣下去鳥托邦就會…
Dialogue: 0,1:05:07.63,1:05:09.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們快讓
Dialogue: 0,1:05:25.05,1:05:27.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們幾個\N趕快過 來抓緊我
Dialogue: 0,1:05:41.03,1:05:41.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好厲害喔
Dialogue: 0,1:05:41.90,1:05:44.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這就是傳說中的羽翼
Dialogue: 0,1:05:51.28,1:05:53.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,歐蒂雅 你沒事吧？
Dialogue: 0,1:05:58.28,1:06:01.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你一定要稱下去\N加油啊
Dialogue: 0,1:06:03.56,1:06:05.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伊卡洛斯 小寶寶…
Dialogue: 0,1:06:06.06,1:06:07.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,危險
Dialogue: 0,1:06:14.27,1:06:16.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 是天空耶
Dialogue: 0,1:06:22.68,1:06:23.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,聽好了
Dialogue: 0,1:06:23.61,1:06:26.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們現在要一口氣\N飛到拉拉亞多山
Dialogue: 0,1:06:26.78,1:06:28.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們抓緊喔
Dialogue: 0,1:06:39.23,1:06:40.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們終于到了
Dialogue: 0,1:06:40.59,1:06:44.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,腓尼基的力量就是\N被封印在這個龍之谷下面
Dialogue: 0,1:06:44.60,1:06:47.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要讓這股力量重新復活
Dialogue: 0,1:06:47.33,1:06:51.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后把人類世界的鳥類\N全都移居到這鳥托邦來
Dialogue: 0,1:06:51.64,1:06:56.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,從持續破壞環境的人類手中\N把我們的同伴救出來
Dialogue: 0,1:06:57.38,1:06:58.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,絕對不行
Dialogue: 0,1:06:59.35,1:07:00.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,貓頭鷹博士？
Dialogue: 0,1:07:00.61,1:07:01.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要是這么做的話
Dialogue: 0,1:07:02.11,1:07:04.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人類世界的生態\N就會變得很詭異
Dialogue: 0,1:07:05.15,1:07:08.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鳥本來就應該跟人類一起生活
Dialogue: 0,1:07:08.62,1:07:09.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,博士
Dialogue: 0,1:07:09.39,1:07:12.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我把你帶來這里\N并不是要聽你大談闊論的
Dialogue: 0,1:07:12.83,1:07:15.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,讓我這個\N曾經跟你一起研究的人
Dialogue: 0,1:07:15.39,1:07:17.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,分享研究成果也是應該的吧
Dialogue: 0,1:07:18.13,1:07:19.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要早點覺醒啊
Dialogue: 0,1:07:19.87,1:07:20.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,博士
Dialogue: 0,1:07:20.50,1:07:21.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胖虎
Dialogue: 0,1:07:22.13,1:07:23.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可惡 快放開博士
Dialogue: 0,1:07:24.77,1:07:26.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把這三個人關起來
Dialogue: 0,1:07:27.14,1:07:31.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其他人立刻把這個山谷的雪鏟除
Dialogue: 0,1:07:33.01,1:07:33.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,媽媽
Dialogue: 0,1:07:34.18,1:07:36.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A夢
Dialogue: 0,1:07:37.28,1:07:38.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好冷喔
Dialogue: 0,1:07:40.15,1:07:41.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伊卡洛斯
Dialogue: 0,1:07:41.39,1:07:43.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們先降落一下好嗎
Dialogue: 0,1:07:54.60,1:07:56.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這里是山谷的另一邊
Dialogue: 0,1:07:57.10,1:07:58.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有什么法寶快拿出來吧
Dialogue: 0,1:07:59.17,1:08:00.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,應變燈
Dialogue: 0,1:08:01.14,1:08:02.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這個燈是…
Dialogue: 0,1:08:02.37,1:08:03.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了啦\N不用說明
Dialogue: 0,1:08:03.71,1:08:04.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快一點
Dialogue: 0,1:08:05.78,1:08:07.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇 不冷了耶
Dialogue: 0,1:08:07.88,1:08:08.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真不可思議耶
Dialogue: 0,1:08:09.01,1:08:11.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,靜香跟我還有伊卡洛斯\N也一起來
Dialogue: 0,1:08:11.65,1:08:12.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,1:08:12.62,1:08:14.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伊卡洛斯也會冷吧
Dialogue: 0,1:08:15.89,1:08:16.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:08:16.39,1:08:16.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,古斯基
Dialogue: 0,1:08:20.66,1:08:22.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你沒事吧 大雄？
Dialogue: 0,1:08:22.93,1:08:24.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還好沒什么大礙
Dialogue: 0,1:08:25.13,1:08:26.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 這是什么啊？
Dialogue: 0,1:08:28.13,1:08:29.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好奇怪喔
Dialogue: 0,1:08:33.17,1:08:33.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是人類耶
Dialogue: 0,1:08:34.44,1:08:36.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是立體影像
Dialogue: 0,1:08:36.74,1:08:41.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的名字叫鳥野守\N是二十二世紀的鳥類學者
Dialogue: 0,1:08:41.71,1:08:43.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,二十二世紀？
Dialogue: 0,1:08:43.68,1:08:47.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,討厭人類的我非常喜歡鳥
Dialogue: 0,1:08:47.42,1:08:51.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我原本想跟小鳥們坐時光機
Dialogue: 0,1:08:51.72,1:08:56.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到哺乳類\N還沒誕生的遠古時代一起生活
Dialogue: 0,1:09:11.51,1:09:12.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,得救了
Dialogue: 0,1:09:13.51,1:09:18.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為時空亂流\N時光機撞上了超空間的墻壁
Dialogue: 0,1:09:18.95,1:09:21.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,才會來到多元宇宙
Dialogue: 0,1:09:24.09,1:09:27.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喔 我知道了\N原來這里是別的星球
Dialogue: 0,1:09:28.03,1:09:31.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然很意外\N不過這也是大好機會
Dialogue: 0,1:09:32.36,1:09:36.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這里的話\N不必擔心會改變人類歷史
Dialogue: 0,1:09:36.77,1:09:41.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,當時年輕的我\N如同被惡魔附了身一樣…
Dialogue: 0,1:09:42.47,1:09:44.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為了在這里建造一個鳥托邦
Dialogue: 0,1:09:45.51,1:09:49.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,于是我任意將各種鳥類進化
Dialogue: 0,1:09:55.02,1:09:58.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,之后我教導鳥人\N所有我所知道的知識
Dialogue: 0,1:09:59.56,1:10:00.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這么說的話
Dialogue: 0,1:10:00.76,1:10:04.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,古斯基的祖先\N是鳥野博士創造出來的
Dialogue: 0,1:10:05.30,1:10:07.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,動作快 不行休息
Dialogue: 0,1:10:07.43,1:10:10.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們要把這個山谷的雪全都鏟平
Dialogue: 0,1:10:10.74,1:10:13.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,腓尼基的力量是什么啊
Dialogue: 0,1:10:13.07,1:10:14.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也不知道
Dialogue: 0,1:10:14.51,1:10:16.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,說什么話 還不快做事
Dialogue: 0,1:10:20.31,1:10:24.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是鳥托邦也有鳥類的天敵
Dialogue: 0,1:10:31.56,1:10:35.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我最后的工作\N就是要想辦法把它解決掉
Dialogue: 0,1:10:36.33,1:10:39.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,于是我把它引誘到\N這個北端的山谷來
Dialogue: 0,1:10:40.17,1:10:41.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,開始爆破
Dialogue: 0,1:10:56.05,1:10:58.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我讓它沉睡在這個冰山下
Dialogue: 0,1:10:58.98,1:11:01.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我已經完成了我的工作
Dialogue: 0,1:11:01.85,1:11:03.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鳥托邦的孩子們記住
Dialogue: 0,1:11:04.19,1:11:07.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,千萬不可以把腓尼基喚醒過來…
Dialogue: 0,1:11:09.09,1:11:12.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,聽起來腓尼基\N好像是一頭巨大的猛獸
Dialogue: 0,1:11:12.23,1:11:14.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們快趕過去吧
Dialogue: 0,1:11:14.07,1:11:17.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原來它就是腓尼基的力量…
Dialogue: 0,1:11:22.57,1:11:24.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,長官 要喚醒它嗎？
Dialogue: 0,1:11:25.48,1:11:27.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對了 我怎么會沒想到呢
Dialogue: 0,1:11:27.88,1:11:29.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可以由我來控制它
Dialogue: 0,1:11:29.88,1:11:34.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后再把它\N從鳥托邦送到人類的世界去
Dialogue: 0,1:11:46.40,1:11:47.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,腓尼基啊
Dialogue: 0,1:11:47.67,1:11:50.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是我讓你再度蘇醒過來的
Dialogue: 0,1:11:50.44,1:11:53.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以 你要聽從我的指示
Dialogue: 0,1:11:54.41,1:11:55.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你這個大壞蛋
Dialogue: 0,1:11:55.51,1:11:57.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胖虎
Dialogue: 0,1:12:03.92,1:12:05.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,腓尼基 給我安靜下來
Dialogue: 0,1:12:05.95,1:12:06.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伊卡洛斯
Dialogue: 0,1:12:09.69,1:12:11.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,傳說中的英雄
Dialogue: 0,1:12:11.36,1:12:12.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是伊卡洛斯
Dialogue: 0,1:12:14.69,1:12:15.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伊卡洛斯
Dialogue: 0,1:12:16.13,1:12:17.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胖虎 小夫
Dialogue: 0,1:12:17.36,1:12:18.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:12:18.63,1:12:19.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好朋友你來了
Dialogue: 0,1:12:19.97,1:12:20.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,博士
Dialogue: 0,1:12:22.17,1:12:23.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,古斯基
Dialogue: 0,1:12:23.44,1:12:25.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快抓住伊卡洛斯
Dialogue: 0,1:12:25.94,1:12:27.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是干什么
Dialogue: 0,1:12:27.57,1:12:30.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吱古連度想要控制腓尼基
Dialogue: 0,1:12:30.41,1:12:33.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,企圖征服人類世界呢
Dialogue: 0,1:12:33.28,1:12:34.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不會讓他得逞的
Dialogue: 0,1:12:34.71,1:12:36.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是這個…\N找到了
Dialogue: 0,1:12:36.68,1:12:39.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,進化退化放射線源
Dialogue: 0,1:12:39.79,1:12:41.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把開關調到退化
Dialogue: 0,1:12:43.19,1:12:45.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要讓你退化成變形蟲
Dialogue: 0,1:12:46.06,1:12:46.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你別管閑事
Dialogue: 0,1:12:46.96,1:12:48.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要做什么
Dialogue: 0,1:12:54.67,1:12:55.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,糟了
Dialogue: 0,1:12:55.17,1:12:56.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,轉到進化去了
Dialogue: 0,1:13:01.67,1:13:04.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,腓尼基又急速成長了
Dialogue: 0,1:13:04.68,1:13:07.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,腓尼基 你要聽從我的命令
Dialogue: 0,1:13:21.76,1:13:22.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,長官
Dialogue: 0,1:13:25.83,1:13:26.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,長官
Dialogue: 0,1:13:36.51,1:13:37.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伊卡洛斯
Dialogue: 0,1:13:38.04,1:13:38.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,巴比倫
Dialogue: 0,1:13:38.94,1:13:40.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜托你照顧一下滋古連度
Dialogue: 0,1:13:41.51,1:13:42.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伊卡洛斯
Dialogue: 0,1:13:50.79,1:13:52.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,腓尼基要去哪里啊？
Dialogue: 0,1:13:54.03,1:13:54.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不好了
Dialogue: 0,1:13:55.03,1:13:58.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,歸屬的本能\N讓它朝鳥托邦的方向去了
Dialogue: 0,1:13:58.80,1:14:00.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鳥托邦有危險了
Dialogue: 0,1:14:00.53,1:14:04.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家把力量結合起來\N一起守護鳥托邦
Dialogue: 0,1:14:05.07,1:14:07.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A夢 我們也一起加入
Dialogue: 0,1:14:08.37,1:14:09.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒問題
Dialogue: 0,1:14:09.47,1:14:10.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看我的厲害
Dialogue: 0,1:14:11.08,1:14:12.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝你們
Dialogue: 0,1:14:12.98,1:14:14.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 我們走
Dialogue: 0,1:14:30.76,1:14:33.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家不要慌亂\N快到山崖上避難
Dialogue: 0,1:14:34.90,1:14:37.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么會有這么可怕的怪獸
Dialogue: 0,1:14:37.94,1:14:39.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能夠戰斗的人快拿起武器來
Dialogue: 0,1:14:40.17,1:14:40.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伊卡洛斯
Dialogue: 0,1:14:40.81,1:14:43.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,候鳥巡邏隊馬上趕來
Dialogue: 0,1:14:49.51,1:14:51.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,開始攻擊
Dialogue: 0,1:15:10.84,1:15:12.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,戰況好激烈喔
Dialogue: 0,1:15:12.20,1:15:14.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A夢 快拿武器來
Dialogue: 0,1:15:14.11,1:15:16.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,說是武器\N其實就是我們慣用的
Dialogue: 0,1:15:16.74,1:15:19.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,空氣炮跟休克槍
Dialogue: 0,1:15:19.54,1:15:22.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,總之先把腓尼基\N趕出鳥托邦再說
Dialogue: 0,1:15:23.12,1:15:23.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,1:15:24.35,1:15:25.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,防身斗篷
Dialogue: 0,1:15:26.35,1:15:31.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,靜香 你們用這個\N帶小朋友們去避難
Dialogue: 0,1:15:31.22,1:15:31.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,1:15:32.66,1:15:33.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家聽好
Dialogue: 0,1:15:33.83,1:15:34.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,千萬要小心
Dialogue: 0,1:15:44.07,1:15:46.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒用 它根本不痛不癢
Dialogue: 0,1:15:46.84,1:15:47.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,讓我來
Dialogue: 0,1:15:51.08,1:15:51.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對了
Dialogue: 0,1:15:51.68,1:15:53.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我還有縮小電筒呢
Dialogue: 0,1:15:53.51,1:15:55.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就用這個把你縮到最小
Dialogue: 0,1:15:58.48,1:15:59.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,防身斗篷
Dialogue: 0,1:16:00.75,1:16:01.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快啊
Dialogue: 0,1:16:01.15,1:16:02.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有小河
Dialogue: 0,1:16:02.69,1:16:03.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,1:16:05.16,1:16:06.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這個地方應該就安全了
Dialogue: 0,1:16:07.16,1:16:08.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,1:16:08.99,1:16:10.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 我的小嗶
Dialogue: 0,1:16:10.93,1:16:12.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,米露 你們在這里等我一下
Dialogue: 0,1:16:13.20,1:16:14.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要去哪里
Dialogue: 0,1:16:19.44,1:16:20.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再這樣繼續下去也治不了它
Dialogue: 0,1:16:23.94,1:16:26.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,腓尼基 你覺悟吧
Dialogue: 0,1:16:29.38,1:16:30.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伊卡洛斯
Dialogue: 0,1:16:30.28,1:16:31.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伊卡洛斯
Dialogue: 0,1:16:33.65,1:16:35.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伊卡洛斯
Dialogue: 0,1:16:42.53,1:16:43.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伊卡洛斯 你還好吧
Dialogue: 0,1:16:44.40,1:16:45.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝你幫了我
Dialogue: 0,1:16:45.96,1:16:47.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,古斯基
Dialogue: 0,1:16:47.13,1:16:48.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,米露
Dialogue: 0,1:16:48.23,1:16:49.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伊卡洛斯
Dialogue: 0,1:16:49.73,1:16:50.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伊卡洛斯
Dialogue: 0,1:16:51.34,1:16:53.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,別擔心 我沒事
Dialogue: 0,1:16:53.71,1:16:55.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,米露 靜香人呢？
Dialogue: 0,1:16:57.41,1:17:03.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小嗶…
Dialogue: 0,1:17:05.42,1:17:06.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小嗶…
Dialogue: 0,1:17:06.92,1:17:08.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對不起 小嗶
Dialogue: 0,1:17:09.72,1:17:12.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,腓尼基根本就不怕休克槍
Dialogue: 0,1:17:12.56,1:17:13.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,空氣炮也一樣
Dialogue: 0,1:17:14.19,1:17:15.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒有更厲害的武器嗎？
Dialogue: 0,1:17:16.93,1:17:17.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒有了
Dialogue: 0,1:17:19.66,1:17:20.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對了
Dialogue: 0,1:17:20.97,1:17:26.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鳥野博士當初坐來的時光機\N或許會有什么武器也說不定喔
Dialogue: 0,1:17:27.57,1:17:30.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們把腓尼基引誘出來\N然后把它解決掉
Dialogue: 0,1:17:30.51,1:17:31.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真不愧是哆啦A夢
Dialogue: 0,1:17:32.18,1:17:34.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那臺時光機在哪里呢？
Dialogue: 0,1:17:35.08,1:17:36.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 對喔
Dialogue: 0,1:17:37.88,1:17:39.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我有一個線索
Dialogue: 0,1:17:40.52,1:17:42.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在鳥棲木的最頂端
Dialogue: 0,1:17:43.02,1:17:46.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我曾經穿過云層地帶\N很仔細的看過
Dialogue: 0,1:17:47.26,1:17:48.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看過時光機
Dialogue: 0,1:17:49.19,1:17:50.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很有可能
Dialogue: 0,1:17:51.03,1:17:52.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我去引誘腓尼基
Dialogue: 0,1:17:54.03,1:17:55.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伊卡洛斯
Dialogue: 0,1:17:55.53,1:17:57.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伊卡洛斯\N你的翅膀…
Dialogue: 0,1:17:59.30,1:18:01.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伊卡洛斯你要撐著點啊
Dialogue: 0,1:18:02.37,1:18:03.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,古斯基
Dialogue: 0,1:18:03.48,1:18:05.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他大打算去引誘腓尼基
Dialogue: 0,1:18:09.21,1:18:10.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,腓尼基
Dialogue: 0,1:18:21.39,1:18:22.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,來吧 腓尼基
Dialogue: 0,1:18:22.79,1:18:24.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你盡量來追我吧
Dialogue: 0,1:18:28.90,1:18:31.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,腓尼基已經朝鳥棲木飛去了
Dialogue: 0,1:18:31.50,1:18:32.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,危險 古斯基
Dialogue: 0,1:18:33.07,1:18:34.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們快走
Dialogue: 0,1:18:57.03,1:18:58.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這里是云層地帶
Dialogue: 0,1:19:05.60,1:19:07.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,古斯基
Dialogue: 0,1:19:13.38,1:19:14.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:19:22.55,1:19:23.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:19:25.32,1:19:26.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:19:27.13,1:19:29.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不知道他們怎么樣了
Dialogue: 0,1:19:29.33,1:19:31.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,古斯基一定做得到的
Dialogue: 0,1:19:32.20,1:19:33.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拿出你的勇氣來
Dialogue: 0,1:19:34.30,1:19:35.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,飛起來
Dialogue: 0,1:19:35.90,1:19:37.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你一定可以的
Dialogue: 0,1:19:38.50,1:19:39.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:19:44.61,1:19:45.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,古斯基
Dialogue: 0,1:19:45.24,1:19:46.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你飛起來了
Dialogue: 0,1:19:47.85,1:19:48.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,古斯基
Dialogue: 0,1:19:48.88,1:19:50.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你飛起來了耶
Dialogue: 0,1:19:55.32,1:19:56.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它來了
Dialogue: 0,1:19:56.62,1:19:57.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄就拜托你們了
Dialogue: 0,1:19:57.52,1:19:58.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,1:19:58.39,1:19:59.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,來吧 腓尼基
Dialogue: 0,1:20:04.90,1:20:06.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有種就就跟我來
Dialogue: 0,1:20:20.11,1:20:23.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A夢\N我們要趕快找到時光機
Dialogue: 0,1:20:23.55,1:20:25.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,像這個時候要用…
Dialogue: 0,1:20:25.95,1:20:28.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對了 就用聲音凝固劑
Dialogue: 0,1:20:28.92,1:20:29.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可行喔
Dialogue: 0,1:20:30.19,1:20:32.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,聲音凝固劑
Dialogue: 0,1:20:32.29,1:20:35.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胖虎 你快喝下去\N然后大聲叫
Dialogue: 0,1:20:35.43,1:20:36.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 看我的
Dialogue: 0,1:20:52.71,1:20:53.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:20:55.71,1:20:57.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄\N你在哪里
Dialogue: 0,1:20:57.98,1:20:58.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A夢
Dialogue: 0,1:20:58.98,1:21:00.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 還好吧？\N大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:21:01.85,1:21:02.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,古斯基呢？
Dialogue: 0,1:21:02.85,1:21:03.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不知道
Dialogue: 0,1:21:05.22,1:21:08.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒想到 鳥棲木的頂端\N是個湖泊耶
Dialogue: 0,1:21:08.79,1:21:11.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這些水一定是積了好幾萬年吧
Dialogue: 0,1:21:12.23,1:21:13.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A夢 你看
Dialogue: 0,1:21:15.63,1:21:17.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是鳥野博士的時光機啊
Dialogue: 0,1:21:18.60,1:21:19.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 我們快走
Dialogue: 0,1:21:22.14,1:21:23.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不知道大雄他們有沒有來
Dialogue: 0,1:21:24.18,1:21:25.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 快一點
Dialogue: 0,1:21:28.18,1:21:29.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這里是機艙
Dialogue: 0,1:21:30.75,1:21:33.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,希望電源沒有故障才好
Dialogue: 0,1:21:33.25,1:21:34.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都已經荒廢二億年了
Dialogue: 0,1:21:34.95,1:21:40.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不知道還可不可以用
Dialogue: 0,1:21:40.23,1:21:42.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,應該有設置什么武器才對
Dialogue: 0,1:21:43.06,1:21:44.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,會不會是這個
Dialogue: 0,1:21:47.47,1:21:49.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,休克炮 準備發射
Dialogue: 0,1:21:50.20,1:21:51.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很好
Dialogue: 0,1:21:51.10,1:21:53.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這個東西一定可以打倒腓尼基
Dialogue: 0,1:21:53.47,1:21:55.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 快去通知古斯基
Dialogue: 0,1:21:55.41,1:21:56.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,1:21:56.07,1:21:57.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的白鴿帽借我一下
Dialogue: 0,1:22:00.88,1:22:02.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,古斯基
Dialogue: 0,1:22:04.65,1:22:05.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:22:05.82,1:22:08.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,古斯基 一切都準備就緒了
Dialogue: 0,1:22:08.69,1:22:11.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,聽到我的暗號之后\N就要急速上升喔
Dialogue: 0,1:22:11.69,1:22:12.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知道
Dialogue: 0,1:22:12.99,1:22:14.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 就是這樣
Dialogue: 0,1:22:17.20,1:22:18.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,準備好了
Dialogue: 0,1:22:21.93,1:22:23.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是現在
Dialogue: 0,1:22:30.04,1:22:31.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,成功了
Dialogue: 0,1:22:31.04,1:22:31.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們成功了
Dialogue: 0,1:22:31.88,1:22:33.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太厲害了
Dialogue: 0,1:22:40.92,1:22:41.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,古斯基
Dialogue: 0,1:22:45.19,1:22:46.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A夢
Dialogue: 0,1:22:48.79,1:22:50.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A夢 我們成功了
Dialogue: 0,1:22:51.13,1:22:51.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,1:22:52.33,1:22:54.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,古斯基 你表現得太好了
Dialogue: 0,1:22:54.70,1:22:56.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我用自己的翅膀飛起來了
Dialogue: 0,1:22:56.94,1:22:59.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這么一來腓尼基就…
Dialogue: 0,1:23:03.47,1:23:04.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,1:23:05.84,1:23:06.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,難道是…
Dialogue: 0,1:23:10.32,1:23:12.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,休克槍根本就沒有效
Dialogue: 0,1:23:12.35,1:23:14.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真討厭 還不快給我消失
Dialogue: 0,1:23:14.85,1:23:15.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對了
Dialogue: 0,1:23:18.36,1:23:21.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就讓時光機把它帶走吧
Dialogue: 0,1:23:22.09,1:23:23.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,計時器調到零
Dialogue: 0,1:23:24.80,1:23:25.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣就可以了
Dialogue: 0,1:23:25.36,1:23:27.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,時光機開始啟動
Dialogue: 0,1:23:28.30,1:23:29.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們快離開
Dialogue: 0,1:23:31.10,1:23:32.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇啊
Dialogue: 0,1:23:41.35,1:23:42.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,成功了
Dialogue: 0,1:23:42.48,1:23:45.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這次是真的成功了
Dialogue: 0,1:23:45.08,1:23:46.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它到哪里去了？
Dialogue: 0,1:23:46.78,1:23:49.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可能是在\N地球還沒形成前的宇宙中吧
Dialogue: 0,1:23:59.33,1:24:00.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快去告訴大家吧
Dialogue: 0,1:24:01.10,1:24:01.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,1:24:01.83,1:24:04.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還要把鳥托邦的大火消滅呢
Dialogue: 0,1:24:04.40,1:24:05.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咦？要怎么做呢？
Dialogue: 0,1:24:06.14,1:24:07.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,摩西的手杖
Dialogue: 0,1:24:08.44,1:24:10.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,先設定好研缽型
Dialogue: 0,1:24:11.11,1:24:12.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去吧
Dialogue: 0,1:24:37.14,1:24:38.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,發生什么事了
Dialogue: 0,1:24:41.31,1:24:42.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胖虎
Dialogue: 0,1:24:42.64,1:24:43.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小夫
Dialogue: 0,1:24:44.28,1:24:45.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,腓尼基已經被消滅了
Dialogue: 0,1:24:46.18,1:24:46.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的嗎
Dialogue: 0,1:24:47.45,1:24:48.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太厲害了
Dialogue: 0,1:24:55.55,1:24:56.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下雨了
Dialogue: 0,1:24:56.59,1:24:58.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣大火就會滅了
Dialogue: 0,1:24:58.39,1:25:00.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鳥托邦得救了
Dialogue: 0,1:25:00.53,1:25:01.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,靜香
Dialogue: 0,1:25:01.83,1:25:03.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,米露
Dialogue: 0,1:25:03.46,1:25:04.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 這里
Dialogue: 0,1:25:04.70,1:25:05.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,古斯基
Dialogue: 0,1:25:06.03,1:25:07.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,腓尼基已經不見了
Dialogue: 0,1:25:08.20,1:25:09.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,1:25:09.47,1:25:12.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,古斯基 你自己能飛了
Dialogue: 0,1:25:12.47,1:25:12.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,1:25:13.87,1:25:17.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那個時候不知道為什么\N好像聽到伊卡洛斯的聲音
Dialogue: 0,1:25:18.01,1:25:19.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他說“拿出勇氣來”
Dialogue: 0,1:25:25.92,1:25:30.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就好像伊卡洛斯\N附身到古斯基身上呢
Dialogue: 0,1:25:30.72,1:25:32.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,古斯基 謝謝你
Dialogue: 0,1:25:33.52,1:25:35.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 你是人類啊？
Dialogue: 0,1:25:37.53,1:25:38.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,1:25:38.53,1:25:39.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也是
Dialogue: 0,1:25:39.63,1:25:40.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也是
Dialogue: 0,1:25:41.60,1:25:42.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也是呢
Dialogue: 0,1:25:42.63,1:25:44.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對不起 我們沒有告訴你
Dialogue: 0,1:25:44.44,1:25:45.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,靜香
Dialogue: 0,1:25:46.14,1:25:48.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我都已經知道了
Dialogue: 0,1:25:48.11,1:25:49.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伊卡洛斯
Dialogue: 0,1:25:50.31,1:25:51.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,1:25:51.34,1:25:53.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家都在等你們回去呢
Dialogue: 0,1:25:53.51,1:25:55.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,腓尼基往鳥棲木的頂端\N去了之后就…
Dialogue: 0,1:25:55.91,1:25:57.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 是人類耶
Dialogue: 0,1:25:58.25,1:26:01.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這些人是拯救鳥托邦的恩人
Dialogue: 0,1:26:02.02,1:26:03.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人類救了鳥托邦？
Dialogue: 0,1:26:05.92,1:26:07.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝你們
Dialogue: 0,1:26:07.56,1:26:08.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝
Dialogue: 0,1:26:08.33,1:26:09.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這沒什么啦
Dialogue: 0,1:26:10.09,1:26:12.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其實不只是我們
Dialogue: 0,1:26:12.36,1:26:17.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這都是靠古斯基還有大家\N一起努力才能成功的
Dialogue: 0,1:26:33.89,1:26:35.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,重建工作也很辛苦喔
Dialogue: 0,1:26:36.05,1:26:38.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要大家同心協力\N一定沒問題的
Dialogue: 0,1:26:40.79,1:26:41.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小嗶
Dialogue: 0,1:26:42.99,1:26:47.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,從今以后人類跟鳥類\N也要相互扶持生活下去
Dialogue: 0,1:26:48.27,1:26:52.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人類也不能依賴鳥托邦\N要努力加油才行啊
Dialogue: 0,1:27:06.32,1:27:10.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明年你就可以用自己的翅膀\N參加伊卡洛斯耐力賽了
Dialogue: 0,1:27:11.49,1:27:12.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 謝謝你
Dialogue: 0,1:27:13.02,1:27:16.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且我還要成為一名\N英勇的候鳥巡邏隊員
Dialogue: 0,1:27:16.53,1:27:18.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看來優勝也是非你莫屬喔
Dialogue: 0,1:27:19.10,1:27:21.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的很感謝你們大家
Dialogue: 0,1:27:21.33,1:27:23.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我絕對不會忘記你們的
Dialogue: 0,1:27:23.63,1:27:26.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就讓我們候鳥巡邏隊\N送你們去候鳥航線吧
Dialogue: 0,1:27:27.41,1:27:28.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝你們
Dialogue: 0,1:27:28.67,1:27:30.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咦？小夫他人呢？
Dialogue: 0,1:27:30.61,1:27:31.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小夫
Dialogue: 0,1:27:32.11,1:27:34.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我沒辦法帶你回去
Dialogue: 0,1:27:36.68,1:27:39.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要趕快長大\N然后加入巡邏隊喔
Dialogue: 0,1:27:39.75,1:27:41.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等到那個時候我會再來看你喔
Dialogue: 0,1:27:43.35,1:27:45.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了 我們回家吧
Dialogue: 0,1:27:45.19,1:27:47.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再見了 古斯基
Dialogue: 0,1:27:48.56,1:27:50.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 再見
Dialogue: 0,1:27:55.73,1:27:57.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我一定會再來看你的
Dialogue: 0,1:27:58.34,1:27:59.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再見了…
Dialogue: 0,1:28:00.07,1:28:01.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鳥托邦
